{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://house-technical-designer.local/schemas/material.schema.json",
  "title": "Material Definition",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "id",
    "name",
    "kind",
    "properties"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "catalogRef": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "registry",
        "id",
        "version"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "registry": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "kind": {
      "enum": [
        "GENERIC",
        "PRODUCT",
        "CUSTOM"
      ]
    },
    "category": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "manufacturer": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "properties": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "densityKgM3": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "specificHeatJKgK": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "lambdaWmK": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "emissivity": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1
        },
        "mu": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "sdM": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "acousticAbsorption": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1
          }
        },
        "reactionToFire": {
          "description": "L'euroclasse de réaction au feu, telle que les fiches l'écrivent — « A1 », « B-s1,d0 ». Quatre-vingt-dix fiches la portaient et le schéma ne la déclarait pas.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Les propriétés physiques du matériau. Ce sac reste **ouvert**, et c'est une décision : les fiches parlent la langue du registre de propriétés — `thermalConductivity`, `density`, `vaporResistanceFactor` — tandis que le modèle garde les siennes — `lambdaWmK`, `densityKgM3`, `mu` — parce qu'elles sont dans tous les fichiers déjà écrits. `MODEL_FIELD`, dans `packages/materials`, est le seul endroit où les deux se rencontrent. Les fermer ici reviendrait à choisir un des deux vocabulaires sans la migration de format qui va avec. Les propriétés nommées ci-dessous restent typées : un sac ouvert n'est pas un sac sans règles."
    },
    "sources": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "property",
          "sourceType"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "property": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sourceType": {
            "enum": [
              "GENERIC",
              "STANDARD",
              "MANUFACTURER",
              "DATABASE",
              "USER",
              "CALCULATED",
              "OTHER"
            ]
          },
          "reference": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "validAt": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "appearance": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "hatchId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "fillToken": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
